Artwork provenance
------------------
Original router glyph: three inputs converging through one node to one output on a dark rounded square; no external product logo is used for this extension.
Original geometric integration artwork. The passive SVG source is retained next to its PNG; Go's image/png rasterized the same geometry at 512x512 without external resources. These are not official third-party product logos.
Source: assets/icon-source.svg (original artwork retained in this package).
